 EcphySacErrcL1aCommonRes: L1->L1A , use 0x33C for L1 report , only use commonId=163 , ... differ functions by data [ 0 ~1 ] .	 
 LteEcphyComCmdFormart: 1 ) L1A-> L1 , use 0x02E4 to send ADC / RF temp value query / PchEnhanceVminCnf... to L1. Differ from EcphySacErrcL1aCommonReq for MAX_SIZE ,	 
 2 ) L1->L1A , use 0x33C for L1 to send L1A data , same structure as EcphySacErrcL1aCommonRes.	 
 LteEcphyComCmdL1LogInfo: L1->L1A , use 0x33C for L1->L1A to log L1 info to acat	 
 */	 
	 
 /* EcphySacErrcL1aCommonReq & LteEcphyComCmdFormart differ by MAX_size , use the same opcode ( 0x02E4 ) , share the same commonId definition ( LteEcphyComCmdOpId ) .	 
 EcphySacErrcL1aCommonRes & LteEcphyComCmdFormart & LteEcphyComCmdL1LogInfo different structure , but use the same opcode ( 0x33C ) , share the same commonId definition ( LteEcphyComCmdOpId ) .	 
 */	 
	 
 Int8 commonId ; // details refer to LteEcphyComCmdOpId	 
 Int8 lenOfPara ; // UNIT byte	 
 Int8 dummy [ 2 ] ;	 
 Int8 para [ 256 ] ;	 
 } LteEcphyComCmdFormart;

